  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (Site Location Plan, 2022/77/BRH/101/A, 2022/77/BRH/102/A1, 2022/77/BRH/103/A2, 2022/77/BRH/104,  2022/77/BRH/105, Energy Strategy, Fire Safety Statement - received 4th July 2022) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - Prior to the occupation of the development hereby approved full details of the siting, design and size of the waste and recycling bin storage for each flat shall be submitted and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved details shall be fully implemented prior to occupation and retained thereafter.\nReason: To ensure the adequate provision of waste and recycling bin storage for future occupiers in accordance with London Plan policy D6 and Local Plan policy EQ7.",
    "Condition : 4 - Prior to the occupation of the development hereby approved full details of the siting, design and size of the cycle storage for each flat shall be submitted and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The approved details shall be fully implemented prior to occupation and retained thereafter.\nReason: To ensure the adequate provision of cycle storage for future occupiers of the site in accordance with London Plan policy T5 and Local Plan policy EC2."
